  "description": "The Antonine Itinerary places a road station named Ad Novas on a route from Tocolosida (modern Bled Takourart) to Tingi (modern Tangier). Modern scholars tentatively associate Ad Novas with some Roman archaeological remains at modern Souiyar in Morocco.",
